@host = http://localhost:5070
@classId = c09d9936-1022-4f23-8425-ceb44d2436c9

### Hold a seat -> 201 Created
POST {{host}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds
X-Student-Id: 20101234567890123

### Same student again -> 409 Conflict
POST {{host}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds
X-Student-Id: 20101234567890123

### Missing X-Student-Id -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds

### Unknown class -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/classes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/holds
X-Student-Id: 20101234567890123
